legend left
All P identifiers are SYMBOLIC_SCENARIO; actual runtime identity UNKNOWN.
L = TRANSACTION_LOGICAL_SCOPE; P = TRANSACTION_PHYSICAL
S = TRANSACTION_SUSPENDED; SP = TRANSACTION_SAVEPOINT
